  "name": "Curtain Step & Veil Transposition",
  "description": "\u00a7e\u00a7lCurtain Step:\u00a7r\nPress your Primary Ability key to throw a harmless veil pearl. Curtain Step has a 3-second cooldown. After teleporting, you become \u00a7c\u00a7l[Unstable]\u00a7r for 15 seconds. Using Curtain Step again while Unstable applies \u00a7c\u00a7l[Reality Shatter]\u00a7r for 15 seconds; repeated misuse extends Reality Shatter by 10 seconds per use, up to 90 seconds.\n \n\u00a7e\u00a7lVeil Transposition:\u00a7r\nSneak and press your Primary Ability key while looking at a creature within 32 blocks to exchange positions with it and apply \u00a7c\u00a7l[Reality Shatter]\u00a7r to the target for 5 seconds."
